# Licensed third-party 3D assets (the Fab EULA forbids standalone redistribution
# in a public repo) stay in the ignored `cow assets/` folder. assets/models/
# holds only the project's own Meshy-generated models; see PROVENANCE.md there.
assets/models/*.glb
!assets/models/*.glb
# Raw Meshy downloads; `npm run models:optimize` turns them into assets/models/.
.meshy/

# internal working correspondence, not part of the project
AGENT-REQUESTS.md
